<title>USA: Orbital has more than $700 mln backlog.</title>
<headline>Orbital has more than $700 mln backlog.</headline>
<dateline>DULLES, Va. 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orbital Sciences Corp said Monday that it won more than $1 billion in new orders in 1996.</p>
<p>The company said new orders for its infrastructure systems outpaced revenues by more than 2.5 to 1, which it said is one of its highest &quot;book-to-bill&quot; ratios.</p>
<p>Orbital said that as a result, final 1996 results will reflect firm contract backlog of more than $700 million and total contract backlog, including options, of more than $2 billion.</p>
</text>
